WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:17.251
Bird's stamps flew everywhere!

2
00:00:17.252 --> 00:00:24.631
Some landed in the branches.

3
00:00:24.632 --> 00:00:28.941
Some landed on the grass.

4
00:00:28.942 --> 00:00:35.016
One stamp landed somewhere else.

5
00:00:35.017 --> 00:00:46.355
"I am so sorry, Bird!" said Kip.

6
00:00:46.356 --> 00:00:51.034
"It's okay," said Bird.

7
00:00:51.035 --> 00:00:53.577
"I can find the stamps."

8
00:00:53.578 --> 00:01:02.319
"No," said Kip. "We can find the stamps."

9
00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:08.079
The two friends looked for Bird's stamps.

10
00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:12.868
Bird looked high.

11
00:01:12.869 --> 00:01:24.334
And Kip looked low.

12
00:01:24.335 --> 00:01:28.676
Bird found some up in the branches.

13
00:01:28.677 --> 00:01:38.327
Kip found some down in the grass.

14
00:01:38.328 --> 00:01:43.430
Soon they had a bunch of stamps.

15
00:01:43.431 --> 00:01:50.959
They brought them back to Bird's nest.

16
00:01:50.960 --> 00:02:01.484
Bird put the stamps back in the box.

17
00:02:01.485 --> 00:02:15.823
Kip looked around one more time.

18
00:02:15.824 --> 00:02:24.396
"I don't see any more stamps," Kip said.

19
00:02:24.397 --> 00:02:30.446
"I think we found all of them."

20
00:02:30.447 --> 00:02:37.673
"No," said Bird. "One stamp is missing.

21
00:02:37.674 --> 00:02:45.253
And it's my favorite one—the bird stamp!"
